6137646ff5fe3c9ebd8bdfae15d5d67f.answer_logic:
\(Since\) \( PA \) and \( PB \) are \(tangents from an external point\) \( P \),
\begin{aligned} \[ PA = PB \\quad (\text{tangents from ext. pt.}) \] \end{aligned}
Thus, \( \triangle PAB \) is an isosceles \(triangle.\) \begin{aligned} \[ \angle PAB = \angle PBA \\quad (\text{base } \angle \text{s, isos. } \triangle) \] \end{aligned}
\begin{aligned} \[ \angle PAB = \frac{180\degree - \angle APB}{2} \\quad (\angle \text{ sum of } \triangle) \] \end{aligned}
\[ \angle PAB = \frac{180\degree - 40\degree}{2} = 70\degree \] \(Since\) \( PA \) is the \(tangent to the circle at\) \( A \),
\begin{aligned} \[ \angle OAP = 90\degree \\quad (\text{tangent } \perp \text{ radius}) \] \end{aligned} \(Therefore,\) \[ \angle OAB = \angle OAP - \angle PAB \]
\[ \angle OAB = 90\degree - 70\degree \]
\[ \angle OAB = 20\degree \]

6137646ff5fe3c9ebd8bdfae15d5d67f.answer_logic_zh:
由於 \( PA \) 和 \( PB \) 是由外點 \( P \) 所引的切線，
\begin{aligned} \[ PA = PB \\quad (\text{切線長}) \] \end{aligned}
因此，\( \triangle PAB \) 是等腰三角形。
\begin{aligned} \[ \angle PAB = \angle PBA \\quad (\text{等腰 } \triangle \text{ 底角}) \] \end{aligned}
\begin{aligned} \[ \angle PAB = \frac{180\degree - \angle APB}{2} \\quad (\triangle \text{ 內角和}) \] \end{aligned}
\[ \angle PAB = \frac{180\degree - 40\degree}{2} = 70\degree \]
由於 \( PA \) 是圓於 \( A \) 的切線，
\begin{aligned} \[ \angle OAP = 90\degree \\quad (\text{切線 } \perp \text{ 半徑}) \] \end{aligned}
因此，
\[ \angle OAB = \angle OAP - \angle PAB \]
\[ \angle OAB = 90\degree - 70\degree \]
\[ \angle OAB = 20\degree \]
